From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Atos <atos@localhost>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 16:19:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] a11y: complete the semantic actions per widget

ReplaceSelectedText: new accessible-action-replace-selected-text callback, TextInput.replace-selected-text(), wired in LineEdit and TextEdit of the fluent, cosmic, cupertino and material styles.
ScrollIntoView and ShowContextMenu: offered on items inside a Flickable or a ContextMenuArea, handled by the winit backend through helpers in core.
ComboBox answers Click like Expand. Switch and RadioButton can take focus.
The testing backend gets accessible_actions() and invoke helpers.
